{
  "meta": {
    "title": "Pinapp Inc. — Workflows n8n TDAH",
    "version": "2026-04-15",
    "note": "Importer dans n8n : chaque objet du tableau workflows est un workflow complet (Import from File, ou copier-coller un objet). Remplacer tous les REMPLACER_* et activer les noeuds desactives (dormants)."
  },
  "workflows": [
    {
      "name": "Pinapp W1 — Tally Lead → Telegram + email prospect + Notion",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "parameters": {
            "httpMethod": "POST",
            "path": "REMPLACER_PATH_TALLY_LEAD",
            "responseMode": "onReceived",
            "options": {}
          },
          "id": "w1-webhook",
          "name": "Webhook Tally",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
          "typeVersion": 2,
          "position": [240, 300],
          "webhookId": "REMPLACER_PATH_TALLY_LEAD"
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "assignments": {
              "assignments": [
                {
                  "id": "a1",
                  "name": "payload",
                  "value": "={{ $json.body ?? $json }}",
                  "type": "object"
                }
              ]
            },
            "options": {}
          },
          "id": "w1-set",
          "name": "Normaliser payload",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
          "typeVersion": 3.4,
          "position": [460, 300]
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.telegram.org/botREMPLACER_BOT_TOKEN_PINAPP/sendMessage",
            "sendBody": true,
            "specifyBody": "json",
            "jsonBody": "={\"chat_id\": \"REMPLACER_CHAT_ID_PINAPP\", \"parse_mode\": \"HTML\", \"text\": \"<b>Lead Pinapp</b>\\n\" + JSON.stringify($json.payload).slice(0,3500) }"
          },
          "id": "w1-tg",
          "name": "Telegram Pinapp",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
          "typeVersion": 4.2,
          "position": [680, 220]
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "REMPLACER_URL_EMAIL_PROSPECT_WEBHOOK",
            "sendBody": true,
            "specifyBody": "json",
            "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.payload) }}"
          },
          "id": "w1-mail",
          "name": "Email prospect (HTTP)",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
          "typeVersion": 4.2,
          "position": [680, 400],
          "notesInFlow": true,
          "notes": "Brancher Gmail/SendGrid ou webhook interne. URL = votre endpoint d envoi."
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "REMPLACER_NOTION_CREATE_PAGE_URL",
            "sendBody": true,
            "specifyBody": "json",
            "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ parent: { database_id: \"REMPLACER_NOTION_DB_LEADS\" }, properties: { title: { title: [{ text: { content: \"Lead \" + $now } }] } } }) }}"
          },
          "id": "w1-notion",
          "name": "Notion log (squelette)",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
          "typeVersion": 4.2,
          "position": [900, 300],
          "disabled": true,
          "notes": "Activer et remplacer par le noeud Notion natif + credentials."
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "respondWith": "json",
            "responseBody": "={\"ok\":true}",
            "options": {}
          },
          "id": "w1-resp",
          "name": "Repondre 200",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
          "typeVersion": 1.1,
          "position": [1120, 300]
        }
      ],
      "connections": {
        "Webhook Tally": {
          "main": [[{ "node": "Normaliser payload", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
        },
        "Normaliser payload": {
          "main": [[{ "node": "Telegram Pinapp", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
        },
        "Telegram Pinapp": {
          "main": [[{ "node": "Email prospect (HTTP)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
        },
        "Email prospect (HTTP)": {
          "main": [[{ "node": "Repondre 200", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
        }
      },
      "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" }
    },
    {
      "name": "Pinapp W2 — Relance lead non traite 2h → Telegram",
      "active": false,
      "nodes": [
        {
          "parameters": {
            "rule": {
              "interval": [{ "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 30 }]
            }
          },
          "id": "w2-cron",
          "name": "Toutes les 30 min",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
          "typeVersion": 1.2,
          "position": [240, 300]
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "content": "## W2 Relance 2h\n\n1. Lire les leads Notion (ou DB) sans statut traite et cree il y a > 2h.\n2. Si trouve : Telegram Pinapp avec resume.\n3. Eviter doublons : marquer relance_envoyee.\n\nREMPLACER : requete Notion / SQL puis brancher le noeud HTTP Telegram.",
            "height": 320,
            "width": 400
          },
          "id": "w2-note",
          "name": "Instructions",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [420, 140]
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "assignments": {
              "assignments": [
                {
                  "id": "w2a",
                  "name": "status",
                  "value": "REMPLACER_brancher_Not puis_HTTP_Telegram",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "options": {}
          },
          "id": "w2-set",
          "name": "Squelette (a completer)",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
          "typeVersion": 3.4,
          "position": [480, 360]
        }
      ],
      "connections": {
        "Toutes les 30 min": {
          "main": [[{ "node": "Squelette (a completer)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
        }
      },
      "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" }
    },
    {
      "name": "Pinapp W3 — Waitlist Tally → email confirmation + Notion",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "parameters": {
            "httpMethod": "POST",
            "path": "REMPLACER_PATH_TALLY_WAITLIST",
            "responseMode": "onReceived",
            "options": {}
          },
          "id": "w3-wh",
          "name": "Webhook Waitlist",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
          "typeVersion": 2,
          "position": [240, 300],
          "webhookId": "REMPLACER_PATH_TALLY_WAITLIST"
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "REMPLACER_URL_WAITLIST_CONFIRM_EMAIL",
            "sendBody": true,
            "specifyBody": "json",
            "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body ?? $json) }}"
          },
          "id": "w3-mail",
          "name": "Email confirmation",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
          "typeVersion": 4.2,
          "position": [480, 300]
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "respondWith": "json",
            "responseBody": "={\"ok\":true}",
            "options": {}
          },
          "id": "w3-resp",
          "name": "Repondre 200",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
          "typeVersion": 1.1,
          "position": [720, 300]
        }
      ],
      "connections": {
        "Webhook Waitlist": {
          "main": [[{ "node": "Email confirmation", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
        },
        "Email confirmation": {
          "main": [[{ "node": "Repondre 200", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
        }
      },
      "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" }
    },
    {
      "name": "Pinapp W4 — Lancement formation → blast waitlist (dormant)",
      "active": false,
      "nodes": [
        {
          "parameters": {},
          "id": "w4-man",
          "name": "Declencheur manuel",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [240, 300]
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "content": "## W4 Dormant\n\nBrancher segment waitlist (Notion/Brevo) + template email \"formation disponible\". Ne pas activer avant la liste prete.",
            "height": 260,
            "width": 380
          },
          "id": "w4-note",
          "name": "Lisez-moi",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [400, 120]
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "REMPLACER_URL_BATCH_EMAIL_SERVICE",
            "sendBody": true,
            "specifyBody": "json",
            "jsonBody": "={\"campaign\":\"REMPLACER_CAMPAIGN_ID\",\"segment\":\"waitlist_formation\"}"
          },
          "id": "w4-http",
          "name": "Blast segmente (stub)",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
          "typeVersion": 4.2,
          "position": [480, 360],
          "disabled": true
        }
      ],
      "connections": {
        "Declencheur manuel": {
          "main": [[{ "node": "Blast segmente (stub)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
        }
      },
      "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" }
    },
    {
      "name": "Pinapp W5 — Recap quotidien 8h → Telegram Pinapp + M&P",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "parameters": {
            "rule": {
              "interval": [{ "field": "cronExpression", "expression": "0 8 * * *" }]
            }
          },
          "id": "w5-cron",
          "name": "Chaque jour 8h",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
          "typeVersion": 1.2,
          "position": [240, 300]
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.telegram.org/botREMPLACER_BOT_TOKEN_PINAPP/sendMessage",
            "sendBody": true,
            "specifyBody": "json",
            "jsonBody": "={\"chat_id\":\"REMPLACER_CHAT_ID_PINAPP\",\"text\":\"📊 Recap Pinapp — REMPLACER : agréger leads / waitlist / deploiements / QR.\"}"
          },
          "id": "w5-tg1",
          "name": "Telegram Pinapp",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
          "typeVersion": 4.2,
          "position": [480, 220]
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.telegram.org/botREMPLACER_BOT_TOKEN_MP/sendMessage",
            "sendBody": true,
            "specifyBody": "json",
            "jsonBody": "={\"chat_id\":\"REMPLACER_CHAT_ID_MP\",\"text\":\"🌿 Recap M&P — REMPLACER : stats journee memoireetpresence.\"}"
          },
          "id": "w5-tg2",
          "name": "Telegram M&P",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
          "typeVersion": 4.2,
          "position": [480, 400]
        }
      ],
      "connections": {
        "Chaque jour 8h": {
          "main": [
            [
              { "node": "Telegram Pinapp", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
              { "node": "Telegram M&P", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" }
    },
    {
      "name": "Pinapp W6 — Deploy GitHub → statut Telegram Pinapp",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "parameters": {
            "httpMethod": "POST",
            "path": "REMPLACER_PATH_DEPLOY_HOOK",
            "responseMode": "onReceived",
            "options": {}
          },
          "id": "w6-wh",
          "name": "Webhook deploy (fallback)",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
          "typeVersion": 2,
          "position": [240, 480],
          "webhookId": "REMPLACER_PATH_DEPLOY_HOOK"
        },
        {
          "parameters": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.telegram.org/botREMPLACER_BOT_TOKEN_PINAPP/sendMessage",
            "sendBody": true,
            "specifyBody": "json",
            "jsonBody": "={\"chat_id\":\"REMPLACER_CHAT_ID_PINAPP\",\"text\":\"Deploy : \" + JSON.stringify($json.body ?? $json).slice(0,3000) }"
          },
          "id": "w6-tg",
          "name": "Telegram statut",
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
          "typeVersion": 4.2,
          "position": [520, 380]
        }
      ],
      "connections": {
        "Webhook deploy (fallback)": {
          "main": [[{ "node": "Telegram statut", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
        }
      },
      "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" }
    },
    {
